apiworkbench (1.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Load testing: run one request or a collection with up to 1,000
    parallel users, by iterations, duration or until stopped, with live
    throughput and latency percentiles. Every call can be logged with
    its response and saved as an HTML, CSV or JSON report.
  * Lower memory use: bounded runner history and response previews,
    cached JSON rendering, network clients closed when replaced.
  * Phone layout improvements.

 -- Dhivakar R <dhivakar1010@gmail.com>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 02:30:00 +0530

apiworkbench (1.0.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix broken 1.0.0 package: the Flutter engine libraries
    (libflutter_linux_gtk.so, libapp.so) were stripped from the source
    tarball by dpkg-source's default ignore rules, so the app failed to
    launch. Override the ignore list via debian/source/options so the
    bundled libraries ship in the package.

 -- Dhivakar R <dhivakar1010@gmail.com>  Tue, 21 Jul 2026 03:15:00 +0530
